{
  "about": [
    "LAYOUT_DESIGNER D-xxx: which add-layouts roles overrides the worker's stale-knob guards refuse.",
    "ONE file read by TWO suites: packages/pipeline/tests/test_knob_guard_fingerprint.py runs each case through",
    "worker._guard_no_stale_scatter_config / _guard_no_stale_geographic_config, and",
    "packages/frontend/tests/ui_designer_layouts_commit.test.ts runs it through layoutsCommit.knobConflicts.",
    "Neither side can change what it refuses without the other going red.",
    "",
    "A case builds a committed manifest from the two real manifests beside this file:",
    "  roles    - the fixtures' column_roles (identical in both files, measured), with any family in `declare` replaced;",
    "  layouts  - each entry is the fixture entry `entry` (default: layout_id) taken from `from`, filed under `layout_id`.",
    "             `from: 2.10` records source_fingerprint, `from: 2.9` records none.",
    "  edit     - knob patches merged into the committed roles, by family and entry index: the override the run carries.",
    "  replace  - the committed layouts the run re-bakes (exempt from both guards).",
    "  refuses  - per family, the layout the guard names, or null when it lets the run through.",
    "",
    "Every mix is a state production reaches: `add-layouts --replace X` on a pre-2.10 tree re-bakes X at 2.10 (a fresh",
    "record) and carries every other entry byte-preserved (no record). The guards read only a layout's id and whether",
    "it records a fingerprint, so an entry lifted from the other file stands for that state exactly."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "all fingerprinted: every layout baked since 2.10, so both guards stand down",
      "layouts": [
        {"layout_id": "grid", "from": "2.10"},
        {"layout_id": "datetime", "from": "2.10"},
        {"layout_id": "scatter", "from": "2.10"},
        {"layout_id": "categorical_group", "from": "2.10"},
        {"layout_id": "categorical_bucket", "from": "2.10"},
        {"layout_id": "geographic", "from": "2.10"}
      ],
      "edit": {"scatter": [{"normalize": "none"}], "geographic": [{"projection": "mercator"}]},
      "replace": ["datetime"],
      "refuses": {"scatter": null, "geographic": null}
    },
    {
      "name": "none fingerprinted: every layout baked before 2.10, so both guards hold",
      "layouts": [
        {"layout_id": "grid", "from": "2.9"},
        {"layout_id": "datetime", "from": "2.9"},
        {"layout_id": "scatter", "from": "2.9"},
